+
+## Work completed
+
+Implemented and exported `createPatch(from, to)`. It validates JSON inputs without mutation, creates
+escaped JSON Pointer paths, recursively diffs object members and equal-length arrays, and uses compact
+indexed add/remove operations for array length changes. Documented the API and added red-first tests
+for empty, nested, escaped-path, root, array, validation, and immutability cases.
+
